            "block_content": "Scheduling is assigned by unit seniority within the Night Service group on a rotating basis. The Sunday schedule is voluntary within the Night Service group. If there are not enough CSR's within the Night Service group, the assignment is offered to all CSR's in accordance with unit seniority.",
