        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Holiday scheduling will be done fifteen (15) business days prior to the Holiday. Employees will be canvassed and overtime granted using the overtime list starting with low overtime hours. Employees that refuse the Holiday will be charged the appropriate number of refusal hours. If no CSR accepts the Holiday canvass it will be extended to the Business Offices by low overtime hours of all locations. If at this point no one accepts the holidays, the employee with the low overtime hours in the Phone Center will be forced to work. If there is a tie of overtime hours, the employee with the highest unit seniority will prevail. If the employee is scheduled for vacation (3 days or more) during the holiday, the employee will not be asked or forced.",
